music BGM08D.mp3
text Later that night.
text As always, I'm just lying around in Sunohara's room.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGSH19B"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGSH19B.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound F8O.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text You know, I was with this second-year guy today, so I asked him.
text @[Tomoya]
text About what?
sound F8P.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text About Yukine-chan.
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text @[Tomoya]
text Hm...
text I rise from the floor.
text @[Tomoya]
text What did he say?
setvar strS[1001] = "CGSH15B"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGSH15B.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound F8Q.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text There seem to be rumors involving her and people like that "friend" we met today.
sound F8R.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text What's more, it's not only one or two people we're talking about here.
sound F8S.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text She seems to have quite a number of such acquaintances.
text @[Tomoya]
text Well, she did say so herself...
sound F8T.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text Her classmates are all question marks about her relationship with those people.
sound F8U.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text You see, she's just a perfectly normal girl.
text It's totally reasonable for anyone to question that.
sound F8V.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text Well, not just normal. Her grades are good; she's an actual honor student.
sound F8W.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text She's even popular in her class.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGSH16B"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGSH16B.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound F8X.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text But it seems in the past, those people have come directly to her classroom to meet her.
sound F8Y.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text Then they must have realized that was too much and switched to a different place.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGSH15B"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGSH15B.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound F8Z.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text Well, the reference room seems like the perfect location. Nobody ever comes there, and the window connects right to the back garden. No one would notice if you snuck in through there.
text @[Tomoya]
text But... who would go through all that just to meet a friend, normally?
setvar strS[1001] = "CGSH18B"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGSH18B.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound F90.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text An important friend, maybe?
text @[Tomoya]
text For people like them? I think I'm going to shed a tear...
sound F91.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text Well, the second-year guy did tell me how it could be of philanthropic nature, though.
sound F92.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text If you look at it that way, well, it's not impossible, right?
text @[Tomoya]
text What's not?
setvar strS[1001] = "CGSH13B"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGSH13B.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound F93.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text Trying to be an outlaw all the time doesn't help with loneliness. Right?
text @[Tomoya]
text So you're saying they're lonely...? Do they look like kids to you?
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text With that said, I lie back down on the floor again.
